WEBVTT

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.870
Wow, it's huge! So this is the Mount Iselina.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:54.010
If we cross this mountain, the Republic will be right in front of our eyes.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:59.530
That's nice. That means the clue to Zoid Eve will be in front of our eyes too!

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:04.900
Let's eat a nice meal and get our energy up, so we can go over it in one go.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.030
Let's set out at once.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.700
But we haven't had breakfast.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.900
We don't know when will the
 Imperial Forces catch up to us.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.360
But breakfast...

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.490
Besides, looks like some fog is forming.

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:16.390
Fog?

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:19.860
There's a very good reason they call this mountain dangerous...

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.040
Let's go while the fog is still thin.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.010
Ouch! Ouch...

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:28.610
What's wrong, Van?

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:31.940
I'm so hungry it hurts.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:36.110
If you plan on lying, can't you put on a better act?

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:38.960
You got me...

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.250
Let's just leave that idiot behind.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.810
Wait for me!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.550
<b>DATS & Zoids-Anime Present:</b>

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.550
<b>Within the Fog of Mount Iselina</b>

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:54.090
Viola. Forget about me and live as you like.

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.260
Rosso!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.240
That's impossible!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.530
I won't ever forgive them.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.600
Jarro, nice job.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.830
Are Marx's underlings still wandering around?

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:37.770
Nope.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:38.140
I see.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.390
Viola. I have found out their whereabouts.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.540
It's reliable information.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:47.920
Those guys entered Mount Iselina this morning.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.860
You said Mount Iselina?

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:01.400
Fiine and Irvine aren't back yet? Wonder if they're lost?

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.520
I wonder how things became like this...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.050
Like I said, I'm so hungry I'm started to hallucinate.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:17.510
I am the transporter of the desert...

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:24.020
It's good to be always happy...

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:32.410
I am the transporter of the desert.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.250
I'm hungry...

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.690
It's a papaya!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.450
Papaya, wait for me!

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.080
Van, where are you going?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.200
That idiot. What does he think he's doing in this fog?!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.200
I'll get him.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.710
I'm going, too...

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.200
So you jumped out of the Zoid and came back unharmed...

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:59.650
While Irvine and Fiine, who went out to bring you back, are now lost.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:02.950
But, the papaya was flying...

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.600
There was no papaya!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:09.100
I give up. Looks like we're completely lost.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:13.400
Thanks to that idiot running, we are now lost.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.610
What are we going to do?

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.000
We can't do a thing in such thick fog.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:21.100
We should just wait for it to clear up.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:29.810
Besides, didn't Moonbay tell us? There's a reason why Mount Iselina is called a maze.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:36.930
Isn't it because of the mountain's complex roads, and all the cliffs that make it dangerous?

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.100
That's not it...

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.030
Oh?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.450
Do you know why travelers are afraid of this mountain?

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.030
It's not because the roads are easy to get lost on.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.850
There is a real reason why...

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.370
A real reason?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.630
Just like today, when the fog is thick, it will emerge.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:56.190
What will emerge?

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.220
The demon of Mount Iselina, of course.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.820
I've heard some weird rumors around town.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:18.190
That a dreadful demon will appear on the mountain.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:21.230
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.200
So you've come out, demon!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.320
Sieg!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:35.380
Sieg! This isn't the time for you to chicken out!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.780
Hurry up and combine with Shield Liger and fight!

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.280
Are you guys lost?

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:48.280
A Gordos.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.040
The demon is approaching.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.190
That "demon" is just a shadow.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.450
See?

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:03.570
Really...

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:04.720
Who are you?

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:07.050
I'm Rosa.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.560
And you all are?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:13.930
I wonder if Van, Sieg, and Moonbay are getting along...

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.120
Beats me.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.500
But I was really freaked out.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:27.190
It's just a prank by the sun. A shadow is casted against the fog which looks like a monster.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.070
It's a trick of the nature, isn't it?

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:33.200
There are a lot of mysterious things that happen on Mount Iselina.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:38.920
The Elder said that the mountain is protecting us.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.550
The Elder...?

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.630
There is a colony on this mountain?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.640
Yup... it's just around the corner.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.930
Want to come with me?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.110
We're saved...

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.830
Finally! I'm able to get a meal.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:56.670
It's all because of your gluttony that Irvine and Fiine got lost.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.730
You were seperated from your friends?

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:02.170
Well... it was because of this fog. There was nothing we can do.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.860
Don't blame the fog.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.880
It's because we set off without having something to eat. That's why I saw the papaya.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.840
Papaya?

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.210
A hidden village?

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:18.410
Neither belonging to the Empire nor Republic, a small village of a hill tribe.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:25.420
I heard that Mount Iselina is surrounded by thick fog year-round, and is impossible to cross.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.100
They'll be sure to go to the colony.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.390
That's for sure.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:35.020
Then let's just sweep that area. This should be easy...

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:38.140
Jarro! I will decide the plan.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.640
So no complaints.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:14.230
Don't you think you could limit yourself?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:18.050
"You won't know when you will be able to get food during a journey.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.670
So eat all you can when there is something to eat." Isn't that what you said?

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.760
All right then. Just don't talk with your mouth full.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:28.290
Van, the village people went out in the Gordoses to search for your friends.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:33.430
The fog will clear up soon, and your lost friends will surely be found.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.620
Thank you. You're a great help.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:40.820
Van, would you come with me? There is a very beautiful place on the outskirts of the village.

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:43.170
Thank you. Sieg, you can come too.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.850
What an energetic young man.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:53.410
Umm... why are you so...

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.820
So kind to you?

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:55.700
Yeah...

00:09:56.040 --> 00:10:01.310
That's because Rosa has never brought bad people back here.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:07.360
You have crossed through the Rare Hertz? I've heard that is an extremely dangerous place.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.490
Yeah. It was tough...

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:13.160
I want to hear all about it.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.220
About all the journeys you've been through.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.090
A-All of them?

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.100
Umm...

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:26.460
Let's start from where I met Sieg. It was in a ruin near my village. There...

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.000
She doesn't know about the world outside.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.620
But she can mysteriously somehow feel a person's heart.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.970
I'm sure the spirits of Mount Iselina were the ones who gave her that power.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.230
I know of a child like her.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:51.720
But eventually she will lose that power, leave this place, and never return.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.850
Why do you say that?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:11:01.290
This place may be too calm for young ones. Her sister was like that.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:15.300
Only this place... never changes...

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.910
Isn't it wonderful to be able to go on such great adventures?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.330
I-I guess.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:37.030
But even I have one thing that I can tell you about.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:39.910
My sister.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:40.930
Sister?

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.560
What's wrong?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.710
N-Nothing. Not really.

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.900
My sister is a soldier of the Imperial Forces.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.120
I-Imperial Forces?

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.660
Yeah, but she's very kind.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.590
She told me this the day she left the mountain.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:08.660
"I will fight until the day when the world is as peaceful as this mountain."

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.110
She sounds like a good sister.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.870
I'm sure that's...

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.380
That the bandit's...

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:25.690
Van! What's with those Zoids?

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.830
They're bandits.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.180
Bandits? Then they are bad guys?

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:32.090
Yeah. Their target is Sieg and me.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:36.090
What a stubborn bunch.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.900
Moonbay!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.540
You're slow!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.060
Sieg!

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.950
I won't let you lay a finger on this village.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:03.360
You really don't want to fight here?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.460
Lure them to the valley ahead.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.080
There we will settle this once and for all!

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.510
They're fleeing?

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:15.780
What are you going to do, Van? I don't think they are retreating like this.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:18.290
Of course. Let's go after them and settle it.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.340
Let's go Sieg.

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.310
Van...

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:42.910
Nice fog.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:50.740
Where's the other one?

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:57.200
Damn it. A sneak attack?

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.670
Let's go, Sieg!

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.640
So you think you can reach me from there?

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.360
See for yourself!

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.130
That kind of maneuver... but!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.940
Running away?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:37.900
Let's go Sieg!

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:41.410
He fell for it.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.100
Van! It's dangerous to pursue too far.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:54.980
Where'd she go?

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.540
T-The demon of Iselina.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:22.050
The reason I've lured you here is because I know each and every nook of this valley.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.760
Damn it! Which one is the real one?! (TL)

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.010
This will be the end of you!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.940
Damn it... if only I knew which was the real one...

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.020
That's it!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.360
I-It's impossible!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.010
That was a really close call...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.510
But that light was...

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.280
Van!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.260
Rosa!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.780
You...

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.790
Don't come after us again and never lay your hands on this village. Promise me this.

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:34.390
I know...

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.000
Like I would!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.510
That Van... what did he think he could do unarmed?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:48.760
Promise me, that you won't come after us again.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:51.710
Are you an idiot? I really will shoot.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.760
Sister!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.140
Sister...

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.770
Sister?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:01.770
Rosa.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.680
That bandit is Rosa's sister?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.570
That's... a lie, isn't it?

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.860
Why are you fighting against each other?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.200
Umm... that's...

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:19.330
Bandit... I'm sure that's how you described her just now.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.380
That's... that... well...

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:26.710
That's a lie, right?

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:29.010
You are a soldier for the Empire, right?

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:30.630
It's a lie that you are a bandit, right?

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:34.050
Rosa, I...

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:39.310
Please tell me it's a lie. Hey, sister. Sister!

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:46.150
<i>But even I have one thing that I can tell you about.</i>

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.670
<i>She told me this the day she left the mountain.</i>

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:58.930
<i>"I will fight until the day when the world is as peaceful as this mountain."</i>

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:07.960
Looks like I'm exposed. <i>I'm</i> the bandit.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:12.700
The truth is I've been running from the Imperial Forces and tried to escape into the mountains.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.620
Van...

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:16.430
That idiot. What the hell...

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:23.110
You even treated us to a generous meal. That's really too bad.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.950
Van, you lied to us?

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:29.080
Yup, I lied.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.490
You're lying!
 You are not a bad guy.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:34.950
Yup. I am not a bad guy... oops.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.600
You...

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:39.880
Please, tell me the truth, Van!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.470
Like I said.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:46.960
<i>Rosa, I am going to leave this village and become a soldier of the Empire.</i>

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:53.770
<i>I will fight until the day when the world is as peaceful as this mountain.</i>

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:57.280
<i>Forget about me and live as you like.</i>

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:18.410
Listen! Don't ever come to this village again.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.280
If you do, I won't let you get away.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:22.780
Okay, I get it.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:28.100
Van. Let's go before the Imperial Forces come.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:31.290
Okay, let's go.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.970
Sister!

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:37.720
Rosa.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:55.770
You saved me. If you hadn't come...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.810
Ouch!

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.880
That hurt? That lets you know that you are still alive.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.680
Being that naive is lethal nowadays.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:10.830
Moonbay.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:17.860
You have something to accomplish, don't you? Then better not forget that!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:30.410
Viola, you have forsaken the village. Why did you come back?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.680
Elder.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.570
I'm just passing by on a mission.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.770
Sister.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:43.220
But we definitely welcome whoever Rosa brings back.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:44.950
Elder!

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:52.420
Sister, be sure to come back.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:07.460
Most of the fog has cleared now. Shall we search for the Gustav?

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.330
The Gustav is here.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:09.720
Huh?

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:23.870
Hey, you two there. What are you doing out on this mountain? Would you like a ride?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:27.430
Yeah. May I hitch a ride to the foothills?

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:44.250
Thanks to that stupid Van, I'm totally worn out today.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.410
What are you laughing at?

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:52.950
I think I understand why a guy like you would travel together with someone like Van.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.730
Heh. You just realized?

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.400
He's an interesting kid.

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:25.140
Preview

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.480
Yo! I'm Van.

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:27.660
What, what?

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:31.990
A Zoid that looks exactly like Sieg has annihilated an entire troop of the Republican Forces?

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:33.890
I know nothing about that!

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:39.900
The one who saves us from being chased around by the Republicans is an unsociable guy named Raven.

00:23:39.900 --> 00:23:41.900
Who on earth are you?

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:44.910
That's... a black Sieg?

00:23:44.910 --> 00:23:47.080
Next time, Zoids episode 12!

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.410
The black Organoid.

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:52.580
<b>The Black Organoid</b>

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:51.080
Next time, I'll sure be fired up too!
